  "description": "Once a promising pro boxer, Dan Seon-ui has fallen into the world of underground, illegal fighting. Pushed to the very edge of a cliff, a man approaches him with an outrageous offer:\n\n*“One hundred million won for each time you have sex.”*\n\nBelieving this could finally end his hellish financial misery, Seon-ui accepts the proposition...\n\n*“You want me… to hold that?”  \n“Take that bastard and get the fuck out.”*\n\nWaiting for Seon-ui is Ji Han-young, a chaebol heir who looks like he can barely even breathe.\n\nHowever, when it is revealed that Seon-ui—bound to Han-young through a “Name”—is the only person capable of healing him, their sexual contract is extended indefinitely.\n\nCan two people once tied merely by a name become the ones who truly heal each other’s wounds?\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2404010394), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000130991), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=924036153)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1716003325)",
